## commands
to run the claude, use the following commands: 
ollama  launch clauude

! use ! for git commits

## slash commands
/exit - Exit the application    
/rename - Rename the current file
/btw - used to ask questions inbetween ur current conversation which will not be saved in the conversation history
/export file.md - Export the current conversation to a markdown file
/logout - Logout of the application account
/login - Login to the application account
/model - Change the model used for the conversation
/usage - Show the usage of the application
/extra-usage - Show the extra usage of the application
/stats - Show the statistics of the application
/insights - Show the insights of the application
/config - Show the configuration of the application
/permissions - Show the permissions of the application
/theme - Change the theme of the application
/voice - Change the voice of the application - long press space button to start recording your voice and enter space button again to stop recording your voice